{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Change a campaign draft"},"description":"Saves one or more steps of a campaign draft, named by id, and returns it. A step is its name; its number; its template (template_id, a marketing template on that number\u2019s WhatsApp account); the value of each blank (variable_map: a contact field\u2019s key, first_name or name, with fallback text for people who have none, or one text for everyone); its audience, which is a saved audience by its id (audience.segment_id) and nothing else; a time to send it, in a time zone; and its quiet hours, when nothing is sent. Changing the number clears the template and the blanks. A scheduled campaign that is changed is a draft again, and any estimate it had is cleared. It sends nothing.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"audience":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"from_campaign":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"id":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"kind":{"enum":["read_no_reply","delivered_not_read"],"type":"string"}},"required":["id","kind"],"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}]},"labels":{"default":[],"items":{"maxLength":100,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":50,"type":"array"},"match":{"default":"any","enum":["any","all"],"type":"string"},"segment_id":{"anyOf":[{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"tags":{"default":[],"items":{"maxLength":100,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":50,"type":"array"}},"type":"object"},"connection_id":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"id":{"description":"The id in the resource path.","type":"string"},"name":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"quiet_hours":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"from":{"pattern":"^([01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d$","type":"string"},"on":{"type":"boolean"},"to":{"pattern":"^([01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d$","type":"string"}},"required":["on","from","to"],"type":"object"},"schedule":{"anyOf":[